   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Overlap with a fixed-weight ket: $\\langle HWS|e^{\\sum a_{ij}E_{ij}}|\\Psi\\rangle$\n\nIf $|\\Psi\\rangle$ has definite weight $\\mu=\\{\\mu_1,\\mu_2,\\mu_3,\\mu_4\\}$, then only the monomials with $\\nu(n)=\\mu$ survive — all others land in a different weight space and pair to zero. Inverting $\\nu(n)=\\mu$ fixes the margins completely:\n$$m_1=\\lambda_1-\\mu_1,\\qquad m_2=\\lambda_2-\\mu_2,\\qquad m_3=\\mu_3-\\lambda_3,\\qquad m_4=\\mu_4-\\lambda_4 .$$\nSo the overlap is **non-zero only if** all four $m_i\\ge0$ (and $\\sum\\mu=\\sum\\lambda$, automatic since each $E_{ij}$ preserves the total weight, which forces $m_1+m_2=m_3+m_4$). When that holds, the contributing terms are the *single* one-parameter family\n$$\\boxed{\\ \\langle HWS|e^{\\sum a_{ij}E_{ij}}|\\Psi\\rangle=\\sum_{t=\\max(0,m_3-m_2)}^{\\min(m_1,m_3)}\\frac{a_{13}^{t}\\,a_{14}^{m_1-t}\\,a_{23}^{m_3-t}\\,a_{24}^{m_2-m_3+t}}{t!\\,(m_1-t)!\\,(m_3-t)!\\,(m_2-m_3+t)!}\\ \\langle HWS|E_{13}^{t}E_{14}^{m_1-t}E_{23}^{m_3-t}E_{24}^{m_2-m_3+t}|\\Psi\\rangle\\ }$$\ni.e. exactly $\\min(m_1,m_2,m_3,m_4)+1$ terms, a *finite* sum with no truncation needed — the exponential's infinite series collapses the moment the target weight is fixed. It is a single homogeneous monomial in the $a$'s of total degree $m_1+m_2$ only when $\\min(m)=0$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Margins forced by the target weight, and the contributing exponent tuples. *)\noverlapMargins[lam_, mu_] := {lam[[1]] - mu[[1]], lam[[2]] - mu[[2]], mu[[3]] - lam[[3]], mu[[4]] - lam[[4]]};\n\n(* The exponent tuples n contributing to <HWS|exp(..)|Psi_mu>; {} if the overlap vanishes\n   on weight grounds (some margin negative, or total weight not conserved). *)\noverlapTerms[lam_, mu_] := Module[{m = overlapMargins[lam, mu]},\n   If[Total[lam] =!= Total[mu] || Min[m] < 0, {}, marginSector[m]]];\n\n(* Symbolic overlap: sum of coef[n] * <HWS|E^n|Psi>, with the bra monomial left as bra[n]. *)\noverlapSymbolic[lam_, mu_] := Total[coef[#] bra @@ # & /@ overlapTerms[lam, mu]];\n\n(* Concrete overlap in a given irrep, for an explicit weight-mu ket Psi. *)\noverlapVal[rep_, lam_, mu_, Psi_] := Total[coef[#] (braVec[rep, #] . Psi) & /@ overlapTerms[lam, mu]];\n\n{overlapTerms[{l1, l2, l3, l4}, {l1 - 2, l2 - 2, l3 + 2, l4 + 2}], overlapSymbolic[{l1, l2, l3, l4}, {l1 - 2, l2 - 2, l3 + 2, l4 + 2}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
