      {
       "data": "Out[98]= \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1275cb5c-ba03-4edb-9a4d-bf63a2e94c54"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Verification against the brute-force exponential\n\nFor $\\lambda=\\{3,2,1,0\\}$: build $M=e^{\\sum a_{ij}E_{ij}}$ at rational $a$'s, take $|\\Psi\\rangle$ a random combination of GT basis vectors of weight $\\mu$, and compare $\\langle HWS|M|\\Psi\\rangle$ against `overlapVal` — for **every** weight $\\mu$ occurring in the irrep, including those where the prediction is zero.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Brute force: full matrix exponential at rational a-values. *)\nSeedRandom[42];\navals = {7/5, -3/2, 11/7, 2/9};\nnumRule = Thread[{a[1, 3], a[1, 4], a[2, 3], a[2, 4]} -> avals];\nMfull = MatrixExp[avals . gens];\nbraFull = UnitVector[dim[testrep], 1] . Mfull;\n\n(* every weight occurring in the irrep, with the positions of its GT basis vectors *)\nwtPos = GroupBy[Range[dim[testrep]], allWts[[#]] &];\n\ncheck = Table[\n   Module[{Psi = Normal@SparseArray[Thread[wtPos[mu] -> RandomInteger[{-4, 4}, Length[wtPos[mu]]]], dim[testrep]]},\n    {mu, Length[wtPos[mu]], Length[overlapTerms[testrep, mu]],\n     braFull . Psi - (overlapVal[testrep, testrep, mu, Psi] /. numRule)}],\n   {mu, Keys[wtPos]}];\n\n{Length[check], Max[Abs[check[[All, 4]]]], Total[check[[All, 3]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Worked example: $\\lambda=\\{16,16,0,0\\}$, $\\mu=\\{8,8,8,8\\}$\n\nThe rectangular case relevant to the CGC work. Margins $m=\\{8,8,8,8\\}$, so $t$ runs $0..8$: nine terms, all of total degree 16, and $|\\Psi\\rangle$ sits at the *middle* weight of the irrep.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "lamEx = {16, 16, 0, 0}; muEx = {8, 8, 8, 8};\n{overlapMargins[lamEx, muEx], Length[overlapTerms[lamEx, muEx]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"550921\" data-output-id=\"19\" data-out-n=\"100\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[100]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-ms0hx4de-b16rbfr\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1xsZWZ0XHs4LDgsOCw4XHJpZ2h0XH0sOVxyaWdodFx9\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[100]= \\left\\{\\left\\{8,8,8,8\\right\\},9\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "b964fe2f-c0b9-44ce-9963-8b86ca47cc44"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The nine contributing monomials, with their multinomial prefactors. *)\nTableForm[\n  {#, Total[#], coef[#], 1/(Times @@ (#!))} & /@ overlapTerms[lamEx, muEx],\n  TableHeadings -> {None, {\"{n13,n14,n23,n24}\", \"deg\", \"coef[n]\", \"prefactor\"}}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
