  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "The $\\lambda=\\{16,16,0,0\\}$ irrep has dimension 8721, too big for a comfortable brute-force $e^{M}$. So check the *same rectangular pattern* one rung down: $\\lambda=\\{4,4,0,0\\}$ (dim 105), $\\mu=\\{2,2,2,2\\}$, where $m=\\{2,2,2,2\\}$ gives three terms.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Brute-force check of the rectangular middle-weight overlap one rung down (S=4). *)\nSeedRandom[7];\nlamR = {4, 4, 0, 0}; muR = {2, 2, 2, 2};\ngensR = EE[lamR] @@@ {{1, 3}, {1, 4}, {2, 3}, {2, 4}};\nwtsR = patWt /@ ps[{lamR}];\nposR = Flatten@Position[wtsR, muR];\nPsiR = Normal@SparseArray[Thread[posR -> RandomInteger[{-4, 4}, Length[posR]]], dim[lamR]];\nbraR = UnitVector[dim[lamR], 1] . MatrixExp[avals . gensR];\n{dim[lamR], Length[posR], Length[overlapTerms[lamR, muR]],\n braR . PsiR - (overlapVal[lamR, lamR, muR, PsiR] /. numRule)}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">8 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Part::partd1: Depth of object {4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Part::partd1: Depth of object {4, 4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Part::partd1: Depth of object {4, 4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of Part::partd1 will be suppressed during this calculation.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Part::partd: Part specification {4, 4}[[1,1]] is longer than depth of object.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Part::partd: Part specification {4, 4, 0}[[2,1]] is longer than depth of object.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Part::partd: Part specification {4, 4, 0}[[2,2]] is longer than depth of object.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of Part::partd will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
