      {
       "data": "Part::partd1: Depth of object {4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.\nPart::partd1: Depth of object {4, 4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.\nPart::partd1: Depth of object {4, 4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Part::partd1 will be suppressed during this calculation.\nPart::partd: Part specification {4, 4}[[1,1]] is longer than depth of object.\nPart::partd: Part specification {4, 4, 0}[[2,1]] is longer than depth of object.\nPart::partd: Part specification {4, 4, 0}[[2,2]] is longer than depth of object.\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Part::partd will be suppressed during this calculation.\nPart::pkspec1: The expression -1 + k cannot be used as a part specification.\nPart::pkspec1: The expression k cannot be used as a part specification.\nPart::pkspec1: The expression k cannot be used as a part specification.\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Part::pkspec1 will be suppressed during this calculation.\nPart::pkspec1: The expression -1 + k cannot be used as a part specification.\nPart::pkspec1: The expression k cannot be used as a part specification.\nPart::pkspec1: The expression k cannot be used as a part specification.\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Part::pkspec1 will be suppressed during this calculation.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Part::partd1: Depth of object {4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.\\nPart::partd1: Depth of object {4, 4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.\\nPart::partd1: Depth of object {4, 4} is not sufficient for the given part specification.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Part::partd1 will be suppressed during this calculation.\\nPart::partd: Part specification {4, 4}[[1,1]] is longer than depth of object.\\nPart::partd: Part specification {4, 4, 0}[[2,1]] is longer than depth of object.\\nPart::partd: Part specification {4, 4, 0}[[2,2]] is longer than depth of object.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Part::partd will be suppressed during this calculation.\\nPart::pkspec1: The expression -1 + k cannot be used as a part specification.\\nPart::pkspec1: The expression k cannot be used as a part specification.\\nPart::pkspec1: The expression k cannot be used as a part specification.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Part::pkspec1 will be suppressed during this calculation.\\nPart::pkspec1: The expression -1 + k cannot be used as a part specification.\\nPart::pkspec1: The expression k cannot be used as a part specification.\\nPart::pkspec1: The expression k cannot be used as a part specification.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Part::pkspec1 will be suppressed during this calculation.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
