  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (b) The four commuting generators really do span the whole dual module: rank == dim.\n   But the nonzero monomials outnumber dim => linear relations. *)\nspanTest[S_] := Module[{rep = rect[S], all, mat},\n   all = Flatten[Table[nList[d], {d, 0, 4 S}], 1];\n   mat = braVec[rep, #] & /@ all;\n   {S, dim[rep], Length[all], MatrixRank[mat], Count[mat, x_ /; ! AllTrue[x, PossibleZeroQ]]}];\nTableForm[spanTest /@ {1, 2, 3},\n  TableHeadings -> {None, {\"S\", \"dim\", \"#monomials\", \"rank\", \"#nonzero monomials\"}}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
