  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (d) The determinant operator D = E13 E24 - E14 E23 is nonzero on the bra, but nilpotent\n   of order S+1 -- the source of the relations. *)\ndetOp[rep_] := EE[rep][1, 3] . EE[rep][2, 4] - EE[rep][1, 4] . EE[rep][2, 3];\nTableForm[Table[{S, Max@Abs[UnitVector[dim[rect[S]], 1] . detOp[rect[S]]],\n    Max@Abs[UnitVector[dim[rect[S]], 1] . MatrixPower[detOp[rect[S]], S + 1]]}, {S, 1, 3}],\n  TableHeadings -> {None, {\"S\", \"|<HWS|D|\", \"|<HWS|D^(S+1)|\"}}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
