   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Exact classification of the relations\n\nWrite $x_{ij}=E_{ij}$ for the four commuting nilradical generators. The dual module is $\\mathbb{C}[x_{13},x_{14},x_{23},x_{24}]/I$ with $I=\\ker$, and $I$ is completely determined:\n\n**Generators.** $I$ is generated in the single degree $S{+}1$ by the $(S{+}2)^2$-dimensional space $\\mathrm{Sym}^{S+1}\\mathbb{C}^2\\otimes\\mathrm{Sym}^{S+1}\\mathbb{C}^2\\subset\\mathrm{Sym}^{S+1}(\\mathbb{C}^2\\otimes\\mathbb{C}^2)$, i.e. the Cartan component. Equivalently and much more usefully: **the relations are exactly the rank-one degenerations**\n$$\\langle HWS|\\Big(\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in\\{1,2\\},\\,j\\in\\{3,4\\}}u_i v_j\\,E_{ij}\\Big)^{S+1}=0\\qquad\\text{identically in }u_1,u_2,v_3,v_4,$$\nwhile the $S$-th power does not vanish. So setting $a_{ij}=u_iv_j$ (rank one) in the exponential is precisely what kills degree $S{+}1$.\n\n**Explicit form.** Extracting the coefficient of $u_1^{m_1}u_2^{m_2}v_3^{m_3}v_4^{m_4}$ (necessarily $m_1{+}m_2=m_3{+}m_4=S{+}1$) gives one relation per weight sector, supported on the *whole* $t$-family of that sector with multinomial weights:\n$$R_m:\\qquad \\sum_{t}\\frac{(S+1)!}{t!\\,(m_1-t)!\\,(m_3-t)!\\,(m_2-m_3+t)!}\\ \\langle HWS|E_{13}^{t}E_{14}^{m_1-t}E_{23}^{m_3-t}E_{24}^{m_2-m_3+t}=0 .$$\nAll relations in higher degree are $\\mathbb{C}[x]\\cdot\\{R_m\\}$ — no new generators appear (verified: $\\mathrm{rank}(x\\cdot K_k)=\\dim K_{k+1}$ for $k\\ge S{+}1$).\n\n**Consequences.** The graded (by degree in the $E$'s) Levi $\\mathfrak{gl}(2)\\oplus\\mathfrak{gl}(2)$ decomposition is\n$$V^*\\;\\cong\\;\\bigoplus_{a=0}^{S}\\ \\bigoplus_{j=0}^{S-a}\\ D^{\\,j}\\cdot\\big(\\mathrm{Sym}^a\\mathbb{C}^2\\otimes\\mathrm{Sym}^a\\mathbb{C}^2\\big),\\qquad D=E_{13}E_{24}-E_{14}E_{23},$$\nwith $\\dim=\\sum_{a=0}^{S}(a+1)^2(S+1-a)=(S{+}1)(S{+}2)^2(S{+}3)/12$, and degree-$k$ dimension palindromic in $k\\leftrightarrow 2S-k$. The relation $D^{S+1}=0$ is a *consequence*, not a generator. In a sector with margins $m$ the number of independent relations is $\\max\\!\\big(0,\\ \\min(m)+\\max(m)-S\\big)$, which is why the monomial count $\\min(m)+1$ drops to $\\min(\\min(m)+1,\\,S+1-\\max(m))$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (e) The relations are the rank-one degenerations: <HWS|(sum u_i v_j E_ij)^(S+1) == 0\n   identically in u,v, while the S-th power does not vanish. *)\nrankOne[rep_, {u1_, u2_}, {v3_, v4_}] := u1 v3 EE[rep][1, 3] + u1 v4 EE[rep][1, 4] + u2 v3 EE[rep][2, 3] + u2 v4 EE[rep][2, 4];\nTableForm[Table[With[{rep = rect[S], X = rankOne[rect[S], {u1, u2}, {v3, v4}]},\n    {S, Max@Abs@Expand[UnitVector[dim[rep], 1] . MatrixPower[X, S + 1]],\n     Simplify[Max@Abs@Expand[UnitVector[dim[rep], 1] . MatrixPower[X, S]]] =!= 0}], {S, 1, 3}],\n  TableHeadings -> {None, {\"S\", \"|<HWS|X^(S+1)|\", \"X^S nonzero\"}}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"550921\" data-output-id=\"27\" data-out-n=\"124\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"30\" data-sub-start=\"3\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[124]//TableForm=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-ms0iidu6-bjome5r\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue3BtYXRyaXh9MSAmIDAgJiBcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9XFwyICYgMCAmIFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX1cXDMgJiAwICYgXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxlbmR7cG1hdHJpeH0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.600em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.600em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,84c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-92c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,155.3,-396.3,270,-559c6.7,-9